# Satellite data
*.tif
*.geotiff
*.nc
data/

# ML weights. Training checkpoints stay out, but the one the backend actually
# loads ships in the image: without it the scheduler reports idle and the SAR
# half of the app silently does nothing. A fine-tuned YOLOv8 detector is a few
# tens of MB, well under GitHub's 100 MB limit.
*.pt
!backend/models/*.pt

